d the car.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":1.0,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-95-33"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6083028","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"9b2961680112f2655baee0e25f130e59db3965b9c15cce7b1d9156818eece50a","compact":"8dc8ffe434e3bc8b88d497f2236f7ef2fe85dde17656b1869e822362f6293782","nasal":"8dc8ffe434e3bc8b88d497f2236f7ef2fe85dde17656b1869e822362f6293782"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-83-29","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":83,"verse":29,"english":"They, desirous of winning victory, issued out emitting dreadful roars in delight and as if rending the earth therewith.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.803,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-95-34"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6083029","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"5e2bf9960ea6da3f7d7fbe3978a623e0b0852ee4f72fecadce47544d2e18df16","compact":"f78f652ca72540d7ae25fedef3370a32e48d577e6d76add2fa82dc842970f078","nasal":"273adef3948ac18cf854c7f86d8678e05b7cfd57284e861140d301d3be462fa2"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-83-30","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":83,"verse":30,"english":"Thereupon the highly effulgent (Ravana) resembling Death, with uplifted bow, sallied out for battle along with the army of Rākşasa.","alignment":{"type":"1:1","confidence":0.947,"method":"shared-sanskrit-ngram","duttRefs":["DUTT-6-95-35"],"status":"unreviewed"},"source":{"sanskritLocator":"6083030","sanskritFile":"Ram06.txt","englishEdition":"M. N. Dutt 1891–94"},"sanskrit_fingerprints":{"exact":"8929209fd8a37545ed2720a01d34b3ca77e0aea1f0d4834211a314e6a98959b4","compact":"ae257630355f2a48523250e3e32f2be73b6708751d3b7b8b698a446d50e9b677","nasal":"653e696fc175ca0bf3cdbf14c7265b4b19d2e09463c46734b02f64a8aa83f266"}},{"id":"VRCE-6-83-31","kanda":6,"kandaId":"yuddha","sarga":83,"verse":31,"english":"That mighty car-warrior, w